uys. So that was washed, dried, set in sunscreen in this hoodie. Pretty freaking good. We've been trying to figure this out for like years.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Problem"}, {"shortCode": "DbMZqRzv2RL", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbMZqRzv2RL/", "caption": "How to clean your white silogranit sink. If you have questions drop \u2018em \ud83d\udc47\ud83c\udffb", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T00:38:51.000Z", "videoDuration": 159.101, "videoPlayCount": 42, "videoViewCount": 8, "likesCount": 0, "commentsCount": 0, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-bcn1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/753224995_28698994633023403_3375365697298333608_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-bcn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHO9Nw6B2teJR0wq9FkD8Qup4K858AM8mQvUsZIm-5Yph3S4y8BTh_iTEhcss0ZXjY&_nc_ohc=8bpOb574OJEQ7kNvwEF97CS&_nc_gid=z10eaQZ6KuWom7y-bTozAg&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQEGwrpBcsiKQpFgo1mVwZk49FL9ZnbtQmayrvQIi7ZxDA&oe=6A75194B&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.ftfs1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPT1CeLxQpayGHF9ZNuzqP_xpgJYz_eoFG11TpN7XVGkxQZeaMJdvDNszgfLmPXl3qUxEfINBKlJ_MltRaFfMTu7n61r5n6Fh8vwuM.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adq2pHSttGo1uGWOZMD6JkjZuFlv9BhX_X6TBd5njHpQRLX73uVqxsNAxu8NwgyfQg8&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.ftfs1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=uT_gpvSNX3UQ7kNvwGfhIez&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM5NDQ5NDg3OTI1MDYwNSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjgsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwODI3LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoxNTksInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=27e544f951377da&_nc_-pJL6BBUCKAJDMywXQGPjMzMzMzMYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZZapAQA&_nc_gid=uIZyYgPmU0e5NsT7Dql9Mw&_nc_ss=72689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQEqpRaSPjbY3AP_6c7H_Jsm0DKigRi9_OGBNds0fT3ieQ&oe=6A712B58", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "gocleanco", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "27227536713594773"}, "ownerUsername": "gocleanco", "ownerFullName": "Sarah McAllister", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 16, "likes": 0, "comments": 0}, {"date": "2026-08-02", "plays": 42, "likes": 0, "comments": 0}], "still_climbing": true, "transcript": "If your white silicon sink is looking kind of dingy and stained, like even when you rinse it out, there's just kind of stains that are sitting on here, I'm going to show you guys how to bring it back. So it's 50-50 water and bleach, you guys. That's all you're going to use. Pour it in here. Some of it might run down the drain, which is okay. If you have any weird spot stains, I'll show you how to get the water to sit on it. Okay, look how much better that is already. I haven't even scrubbed anything. You can scrub in here too if you want. Scrub to make sure I use the sink because it has a little bit of texture. You want to get into the grooves. Now just let it sit for like 10 minutes. Now this is like 10 minutes later, you guys. Look at it. I'm going to give it a little rinse out, and then I'll show you how to get those stuffs off. That is a million times better already. If you have a couple of stains that are being stubborn, you can put a piece of paper towel and then pour the bleach mixture over the paper towel just so that it doesn't run down the drain because your sink is going to be sloped, right? So this will just give it a little bit more time to work and then come back after like 10 minutes and peel this off. So it's rinsed out really well, but see how I kind of have some scuffs here and there like on the edge? I'm going to show you guys. All I'm using is a magic eraser. Marks from like putting pots and pans in your sink. Get all of this off. Okay, now see these marks just from pots and pans. Take a dry cloth and completely dry it out. Like no water at all. It's going to be bone dry. Then we're going to seal it with just something you have on hand at home. So look how good this looks. Okay, but now we're going 